Z||000002||Terrybogin||05-26-2001||12:27 AM||||Greg (Cooter) has a set of factory 3.4 injectors with about 75,000 miles on them. Want them?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Devotshka||05-26-2001||12:44 AM||||I recently bought a set of those 19# injectors from an employee at a Saleen conversion shop.  They have approx.~20 miles on them.  They work fine, but are just too much flow for my lil v6.  If you are interested in them, just shoot me an email.<BR>BTW, yep, the Ford ones plug right in, they're the same Bosche injector just in higher flow rates  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
