Z||000006||terryk||05-26-2001||10:18 AM||||Unless you're being very budget minded, you might consider new injectors. Used injectors that sit any amount of time can introduce gremlins. At least get them cleaned and balanced.<P>It's amazing how fast injectors varnish up once gas gets in them and sits for any period of time.||||reg||1
